# `npx skills add` writes .claude/skills/* as ABSOLUTE symlinks into this
# machine's checkout path, so they are broken for every other clone. The real
# vendored content lives in .agents/skills/ (committed); regenerate the
# symlinks locally with `npx skills add cockroachlabs/cockroachdb-skills`.
.claude/
